### ResepKu API - Contoh Request
### Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code untuk menjalankan file ini
### Atau gunakan Thunder Client / Insomnia / Postman

@base = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================================
### Health Check
### ============================================================

# @name healthCheck
GET {{base}}/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/register  - Daftar akun baru
### ============================================================

# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nama": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Register dengan data tidak valid (password < 8 karakter)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nama": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### Register dengan email duplikat
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nama": "Budi Lagi",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/login  - Login dan dapat token
### ============================================================

# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login sebagai admin (akun seed)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@resepku.com",
  "password": "Admin123"
}

###

### Login dengan password salah
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "salah123"
}

###

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/refresh  - Perbarui access token
### Isi @refreshToken dari response login di atas
### ============================================================

@refreshToken = GANTI_DENGAN_REFRESH_TOKEN_DARI_LOGIN

# @name refreshToken
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### ============================================================
### GET /auth/me  - Info user saat ini (butuh access token)
### Isi @accessToken dari response login
### ============================================================

@accessToken = GANTI_DENGAN_ACCESS_TOKEN_DARI_LOGIN

# @name getMe
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### GET /auth/me tanpa token (harus 401)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### ============================================================
### POST /auth/logout  - Hapus refresh token
### ============================================================

# @name logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###
